WEBVTT

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
We've only just started walking

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.850
Hey, let's take a little break.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.040
Again? Give it a rest.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.740
I'm starving.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.620
I can't move any further.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.420
We still can't see the coast.

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:30.890
Once we've climbed as high as we can,
we'll search for food.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.000
Put up with it.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:34.140
How do you think it got this way?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.610
You threw our food away!

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.990
It seems you still have a little energy in you.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.300
Well, I won't <i>make</i> you come...

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.080
You're going to leave me behind?

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.870
I just said we should rest a little. Hey!

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:47.900
Well, let's keep it up!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:52.680
Why do I have to be put through this?

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.030
Alright!

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.970
Chako! How is it over there?

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.880
Have you gathered any bait?

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.520
I figured it was like fruit.

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.050
Where's the bait?

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.380
Here, I'll split mine with you.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.580
I'll do it.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:15.870
It's okay.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.600
Let me do it.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:26.500
I'll...

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:27.500
Don't!

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:39.970
Take it away.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.290
Gently...

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.680
Sorry! I did too much...

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.360
This way does work after all.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.350
Let's try again.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.070
Wait, Menori. Howard's gone.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.560
Now he's missing entirely?

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:23.070
I'll go check.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.300
What were you doing?

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.440
I was looking for food.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:42.670
No good?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.280
I'm so hungry, it seems like I'm going to go crazy.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.670
We agreed to climb as high as we could.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.430
Why can't we look for food?

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:57.350
Menori knows I'm hungry and is bullying me intentionally!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:01.640
You're wrong. She has... she has some reason for it.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:03.990
How can you listen to what she says?

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.940
I don't mind if you don't listen.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.320
I never told you you had to come.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.360
If you don't like it then stay on your own.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.420
It's not like I'm following you around.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.100
You just happen to be walking in front of me.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.100
Howard, stop it.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.760
Look, even you're hungry, aren't you?

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:26.260
Let's go.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.810
Why don't we look for food?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:33.700
In the leadership manual, there's an excerpt from
the Boy Scout manual of long ago.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:38.280
According to it, carnivorous animals
are common at the foot of a mountain.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.120
The sun will set soon...

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:45.390
...and I felt that looking for food after we climbed as high as we could would minimize the danger.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:48.550
And you pay attention to a manual like that?

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.070
Listen carefully.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.750
Have you decided to hurry?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.070
We can eat later.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.270
Let's go.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.770
I'm sick of this place!

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.620
Hey! Kaoru!

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:22.340
Just like you said, there was nothing more past there.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.470
And there were monster footprints too.

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.400
You made that from rocks?

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.660
You put some thought into it, but that way's no good.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.170
Leave the fishin' to us!

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:43.510
Although I'm a little worried because we don't have hooks.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.670
We don't need those.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.330
Where are you going?

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.400
I'll look for another spot.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.470
Shouldn't we stick together?

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.360
Shall we rest over there?

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:13.770
Assuming there aren't any dangerous creatures there.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:17.840
Come to think of it, I can't hear the animal noises anymore.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.730
I'm sure it's fine. Let's take a look.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.450
It looks like there's nothing here.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.140
Alright! Now, we eat!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:37.140
Before it gets dark out,
let's split up and see what we can find.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.190
We were so close...

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.860
Then I guess it's my turn next.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.160
It's turned red.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:02.520
Continue like that.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:18.820
Alright, move away.

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:25.750
We did it!

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.700
Put more kindling on it.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.650
We did it! Bell, we did it!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.850
It's warm.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:50.670
We made it in time.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.140
Before sunset.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:05.730
It's sunset.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:06.780
Let's go back.

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:08.200
What're you sayin'?

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:12.720
The best times to fish're sunset 'n just before dawn.

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:16.020
But I don't think we're going to catch anything.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:22.600
You got one? Shingo, way to go!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:31.890
You failed?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.140
It just took the bait.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.870
It was pointless without a hook after all.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.970
I said you don't need one. It's the skills, the skills.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.040
But Chako, you haven't caught anything either!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.350
Don't you think your bait's been taken?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.700
Naw, don't worry about me.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:53.790
What's this?

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.230
It's just an acorn.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:59.470
Yeah, but I'm afraid to touch those wiggly things.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:02.580
We didn't get even one bit of food.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.300
We have to be serious.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.500
No, no.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.810
It's just touchin' those things I'm against.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:34.680
Let's go home.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:36.700
Yeah.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:06.140
The trees are all dead, so there's no food.

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:07.360
What do we do?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:08.790
We'll rely on Luna.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.450
Now there's a plan.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:15.850
You just hung around me and didn't search at all.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.040
I've got something! I found some fruit!

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:20.940
Look, it's so big!

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.170
Alright!

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:23.860
Hurry up and bring it back!

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.870
Can we eat this?

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.760
The bugs were eating it, so it's probably fine.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:37.360
Just because the bugs of this planet eat it...

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.990
Anyways, let's cut it open.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.430
It stinks!

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.670
But it's full of moisture! Let's put up with it and eat.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.630
Isn't it great, Howard? You can finally eat!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:57.670
I haven't been much on fruit for a long time.

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.270
Menori, your stomach was growling too. You eat first.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.220
Under these circumstances, I'll admit it:

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:07.020
While I may look flawless, I have an unbalanced diet.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:11.620
Ever since I was a kid, I've been told I have poor health.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.870
Weren't you eating that fruit this morning?

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.070
That's enough!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.960
And I went through all the trouble to bring it back!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.440
I'll eat it!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.020
It's delicious!

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.620
Where are Luna and them?

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:51.800
Maybe something happened to them.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:52.890
Nothin' happened!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.460
Well, we don't know.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:55.920
What should we do?

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.230
Maybe a weird monster...

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:02.410
Kaoru...

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:04.150
You caught some.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.760
This is well made.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.540
That's great. Make one for me too.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:10.770
Make it yourself.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:12.540
What'd you say?

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:14.620
Take care of yourself.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.470
Why don't we all cooperate?

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:19.700
I'm cooperating.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.440
Like I promised, I brought food.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.210
What are you doing?

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:29.770
Let me borrow it.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:46.530
If you don't gut them, we might eat something dangerous.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:51.050
And there are fish that have poison in their innards.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.190
What would happen if we ate them?

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:55.190
Well, I'm not sure...

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:57.400
It might have been dangerous.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.240
Let's switch.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.870
I'll keep the watch now.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:12.780
Sorry. I didn't even realize.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.540
It's because we walked all day.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.770
I can't eat any more.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:21.210
Any more than this and my stomach will burst.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.760
Have a good rest.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.840
I'll take over the fire watch.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.210
It's okay.

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.480
I'm going to switch with Kaoru in a little while...

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:43.750
...so you go to sleep.

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.240
I can't sleep.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.070
What should we do? What if Luna and them...

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.590
They're those three. I'm sure they're safe.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.950
In the morning, we'll look for them in the forest.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:02.300
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.620
Let's go below deck and sleep.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.650
Are we at the peak yet?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.070
We've only just started walking.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.790
The wind has picked up.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.550
That fog earlier was that cloud, I guess.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.950
Can we stop here?

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:06.050
Can't you see the shuttle?

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:09.070
No, not yet. The clouds are in the way.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.670
And we've already climbed this far.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.470
Let's climb to the peak and look over to the other side.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.470
All the way to the peak?

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.960
It's a little further. Let's keep going!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.200
We're finally here.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.770
It looks like they managed to make a fire.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.350
That glimmering thing is the Shuttle!

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:42.690
I'm sure of it!

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:45.890
Luna, record the relative positions.

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:52.170
That short mountain, that protruding crag,
and the Shuttle are all in a straight line.

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.890
I don't know if it's right or not...

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.120
...but let's call south the direction the sun is currently in.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.950
Okay. This way is south.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:05.070
The sea... The shuttle's beach is west...

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.440
The other side of the ridge is East.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:08.410
More sea?

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.220
Then this way is North.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:12.970
What's that way?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:22.450
The sea.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.390
This is...

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:32.790
...an island.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:34.850
There's nothing there.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.100
..no buildings...

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:37.830
...no people.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:40.720
Are we going to be here the rest of our lives?

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:42.290
Are we going to die here?

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.040
Can't we go home?

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.900
Hey, Menori! Are we?

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:51.160
Say something!

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:54.070
Anyways, we have our bearings back.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.810
Let's rejoin everyone else.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:57.420
It's okay.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:58.770
We can definitely go home.

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.350
C'mon, let's go back.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.830
Where did Kaoru go?

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:11.770
The firewood was added recently, so he must be nearby.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.660
My fishing rod...

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:21.390
Huh? A fishing hook?

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:22.510
How did you?

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:26.490
It's made of an animal bone.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:28.940
Hey, everyone, more importantly...

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.370
Yeah! Yeah, yeah!

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:33.520
Let's go look for Luna and them.

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:34.890
Bell, let's go.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.770
Can you take care of the fire?

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.490
You're going deep into the forest?

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:46.790
You made me one. Thanks.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:53.580
Luna!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.830
Menori!

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:00.690
Howard!

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.500
Menori!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.590
Luna!

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:07.170
What should we do?
At this rate, we'll never see them again.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:09.180
We still don't know that. I'm sure they're fine.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.640
Let's go a little deeper.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:11.650
Yeah.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.830
Bell, lend me the knife.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.380
I'll walk in the lead for now.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:18.420
I have another one.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:22.620
I'll walk in front, so Shingo,
how about you defend the rear?

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.240
No matter what he said, Kaoru made these for us.

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:37.960
It's heavy!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.290
Stand up straight!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:47.820
Okay, that way.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:48.740
Let's go.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.220
I think I've seen this place before.

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:59.050
It's where we chased after that small animal.

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:00.890
Which means we're pretty close.

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:03.440
What does it matter? We're going to die here anyway.

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:08.620
What's there?

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:11.950
Bell!

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.720
Luna! Menori!

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:17.070
Sorry!

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:19.230
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.800
We made you worry.

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:23.990
We figured you were safe.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.930
Stop smiling like a goof! You're carrying this!

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:34.770
Wow! You really made a fire!

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.780
Bell worked really hard!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.410
An island?

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:46.740
Nor is there any trace of civilization,
at least not on this island.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.000
Then how're we s'posed to get home?

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:54.160
It's too early to give up. This is an island,
but there may be other land.

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.430
And you plan to search them by swimming?

00:21:58.340 --> 00:21:59.220
It's the end.

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:01.490
We don't have electricity, running water, or gas.

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:02.790
And help isn't on the way.

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:07.700
We're just going to starve to death in fear of monsters.

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:11.640
But...

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:14.090
...we found a lake.

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:16.810
Those monsters will come out!

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:18.780
But we made it back safely.

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:22.140
And we found food and have a fire.

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:23.940
You shut up!

00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:26.280
There's no point in bein' worried stiff.

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:28.420
Just having water is something to be excited about.

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:33.370
As long as we survive, there's still
a chance we'll find a way home.

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:38.490
There's not near enough water.

00:22:39.070 --> 00:22:40.890
I want to drink 'till It hurts.

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:43.440
Tomorrow, we'll all go to the lake together.

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:44.970
Is it close?

00:22:46.230 --> 00:22:46.810
It's here.

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:50.730
We're here.

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:55.530
If you walk with the mountain with the shallow
crevasse and the landmark crag lined up...

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:03.760
So this was an island...

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:07.270
And there was no sign of any other people.

00:23:07.850 --> 00:23:10.270
It means we can't count on anyone's help.

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:14.860
That means we'll need to make
everythin' from the ground up.

00:23:15.220 --> 00:23:17.670
Keeping water and finding food...

00:23:17.940 --> 00:23:19.940
...are harder work than we imagined.

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:23.900
Fatigue and hunger are building up inside everybody.

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:28.210
Next time: What's important in order to live.
